    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Amagongo ŵakusaka kulekasya kutaŵa Nyumba ja AMBUJE",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 4:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amagongo ŵa ngosyo sya Yuda ni Benjamini piŵapikene kuti ŵandu ŵawusile ku ukapolo ŵala akutaŵa Nyumba ja AMBUJE, jwakusamlambila Aisalaeli, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.4.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.4.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 4:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "jemanjajo ŵajile kwa Selubabele ni kwa acimlongola ŵa maŵasa, ni ŵasalile jemanjajo kuti, “Atukunde uwe kuti twakamusye jemanja kutaŵa nawo Nyumba ja AMBUJE, pakuti uwe tukusamlambila Mlungu jujojo mpela mwakusatendela jemanja, nipo tuŵele tuli mkupeleka mbopesi kwa jwalakwejo kutandilila ndaŵi ja Mwenye Esalahadoni jwa ku Asiliya, juŵatutumisye uwe kukutama akuno.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.4.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.4.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2KI.17.24+2KI.17.25+2KI.17.26+2KI.17.27+2KI.17.28+2KI.17.29+2KI.17.30+2KI.17.31+2KI.17.32+2KI.17.33+2KI.17.34+2KI.17.35+2KI.17.36+2KI.17.37+2KI.17.38+2KI.17.39+2KI.17.40+2KI.17.41"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Ayi 17:24-41",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
